direction_314 = location "Cardinal" about "Cardinal\nA magic organism created when Pathos cast a curse on a scarecrow" found "El Morad " at 1321 1234 in zone 2

On available
    Say "Master, those must be what [Secret Agent] Clarence mentioned!"
    Topic "All right, I'll swing by" goto close

On offer
    Say "Do you know what a Cardinal is?"
    Topic "Tell me more..." do
        Show quest "A Cardinal is a magical lifeform created when Pathos cast a curse on a Scarecrow. No one knows how these monsters managed to wander onto the Adonis continent, but lately we've had a few show up on the outskirts of our village.\n\nIt was only yesterday. A Guard out on a patrol discovered a bunch of these monsters. It wasn't a big deal with only one or two of them around, but they increase in number every day.\n\nAt this rate, the monsters will overwhelm not only our village, but all of Adonis itself. We are currently working with other [Secret Agents] to eradicate them but we're shorthanded. <selfname>, please help us.\n\nI entrust this matter to you. Time is ticking so you should be on the move."

On in_progress
    Say "Quite a few Cardinals have been found in places other than the outskirts of the village."

On ready
    Say "Those monsters were multiplying fast, but you put a stop to THAT! Please go see [Secret Agent] Clarence!"
    Topic "All right, I'll swing by" goto close

On claimable
    Show quest "Thank you! You did better than I expected. You've made our job much easier."
